# Python hooks (editor workflow)

In **Cursor**, prefer built-in formatting, **`.cursor/hooks.json`** (project automation), and CI over ad-hoc one-off tooling.

After editing `.py`/`.pyi` files:

- Run **formatter** (**Black** / **`ruff format`**) consistent with repo config.
- Run **lint** (**Ruff** / **flake8**) — fix autofixables when safe.
- Run **types** (**mypy**, **pyright**, or **`basedpyright`**) when the project defines config.

Prefer **`logging`** over **`print`** in durable application code paths (exceptions: quick CLI tools or mandated scripts).